    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "あれ、そのリップって――",
            "enText": "Huh? Is that lipstick ——",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3749158085728960694,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "は、はい！\r\nシチーさんと一緒に買ったやつですっ！",
            "enText": "Y-Yeppers! It's the one I bought with you!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -587454081374895950,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "ちょこーっとだけ、付けてみました！\r\nもったいねぇから……。",
            "enText": "I just put an itsy-bitsy teenie bit on!\nI'd hate t'see it waste 'way in my bag…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 5653835220658188808,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "なるほどね。\r\nでも、メイクは使ってナンボだよ。",
            "enText": "I gotcha. But you know, you're not going to\nget used to it unless you wear it.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -2825527399659407698,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "け、けンど……シチーさんと選んだから、\r\n大事にしたくてぇ……。",
            "enText": "I-I know, but… that lipstick's chock full\nof mem'ries from our shopp'n trip…\nI want it t'last…",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 7844195263645924030,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "……！",
            "enText": "…!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -8960669373497592645,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "コ、コホンッ……アタシは、\r\n早く使い切ってほしいケドなー？",
            "enText": "<i>Ahem…</i> W-Well, personally, I'm hoping you\nuse it up sooner rather than later.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 2295120315144503928,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "リップ、また一緒に選べるし。\r\nユキノがヤじゃなければ、だけど。",
            "enText": "Cause then we'll be able to go shopping\nagain, won't we? Only if you… want to,\nof course.",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -3457942527467943057,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "わあっ……！　う、うれしいですっ！\r\nぐるぐる付けます！　30周くらい！",
            "enText": "Wow… 'Course I wanna go! I-I'll apply\n'nother coat — no, thirty coats!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 3406798822943985815,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシチー",
            "enName": "Gold City",
            "jpText": "あっはは、\r\nそんな塗ったら荒れちゃうって。",
            "enText": "Ahaha, your lips are gonna hate you\nif you do that.",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 2677302660643135136,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
